#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:5
#: 2bca722cee9746ffbf6d38189bd3e758
msgid "Using SITL"
msgstr "使用 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:7
#: 4a70a9d5b8a342f18e5325980405235b
msgid ""
"This article describes how :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>`"
" can be used to change the environment, simulate failure modes, and "
"configure the vehicle with optional components."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` "
"改变环境、模拟故障模式并为飞行器配置可选组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:9
#: dcf2ec436ed345ac8c78c837ae667a9f
msgid ""
"SITL can be run under Linux using a tool named ``sim_vehicle.py`` from a "
"Linux or WSL2 command line, or through :ref:`Mission Planner's Simulation "
"feature <mission-planner-simulation>`. It can also be run in conjunction "
"with a graphics visualization and/or physics modeling program like "
":ref:`Realflight<sitl-with-realflight>`."
msgstr ""
"SITL 可在 Linux 下通过 Linux 或 WSL2 命令行使用名为 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 的工具运行，也可通过 "
":ref:`Mission Planner 的仿真功能 <mission-planner-simulation>` "
"运行。它还可与图形可视化和/或物理建模程序（如 :ref:`Realflight<sitl-with-realflight>`）结合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:11
#: ae38d315ce23421f8d7ce279524af7a2
msgid ""
"In addition to running the simulation, a ground control station program will"
" need to be run concurrently in order to control the simulation. With "
"``sim_vehicle.py``, `MAVProxy <https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/index.html>`__"
" is automatically started. When using Mission Planner's simulation feature, "
"it is used. You can also have more than one GCS attached, see :ref:`connect "
"to different GCSs <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>`."
msgstr ""
"除了运行仿真外，还需要同时运行地面站程序以控制仿真。使用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 时，`MAVProxy "
"<https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/index.html>`__ 会自动启动。使用 Mission Planner "
"的仿真功能时，使用 Mission Planner 本身。您也可以连接多个地面站，参见 :ref:`连接到不同地面站 <using-sitl-for-"
"ardupilot-testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:15
#: 2f57408090104b7b954114b8c1d42b30
msgid ""
"This page assumes you have already cloned the repository and set up the "
"build environment if you wish to simulate your own code - see :ref:`Building"
" the code <building-the-code>`, although this is not needed if using "
":ref:`Mission Planner's Simulation feature <mission-planner-simulation>` "
"since it can easily run simulations on the current development code or "
"stable code versions."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望仿真自己的代码，本页假设您已克隆仓库并设置好构建环境，请参见 :ref:`构建代码 <building-the-code>`；但如果使用 "
":ref:`Mission Planner 的仿真功能 <mission-planner-"
"simulation>`，则不需要，因为它可以轻松运行当前开发代码或稳定版本的仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:19
#: 536ba3cb7aab4e29bbc0375a2f83661a
msgid ""
"If you're just getting started with MAVProxy and SITL you may wish to start "
"by reading the :ref:`Copter SITL/MAVProxy Tutorial <copter-sitl-mavproxy-"
"tutorial>` (or equivalent tutorials for the other vehicles)."
msgstr ""
"如果您刚开始使用 MAVProxy 和 SITL，建议先阅读 :ref:`Copter SITL/MAVProxy 教程 <copter-sitl-"
"mavproxy-tutorial>` （或其他飞行器的同类教程）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:25
#: 1277745eea5744998357f7dfcafb76ec
msgid ""
"These instructions generally use :ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy-developer-gcs>` to"
" describe operations (e.g. setting parameters) because it presents a simple "
"and consistent command-line interface (removing the need to describe a GCS-"
"specific UI layout). Many of these operations can also be performed in "
"*Mission Planner* (through the *Full Parameters List*) or any other GCS."
msgstr ""
"这些说明通常使用 :ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy-developer-gcs>` "
"来描述操作（例如设置参数），因为它提供了简单一致的命令行界面（无需描述特定 GCS 的 UI 布局）。许多操作也可以在 *Mission "
"Planner*（通过「Full Parameters List」）或任何其他地面站中执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:36
#: 111456c32b9b4d5b8e1c6227afae275c
