#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:106
#: 4782674f93d342a0a1cbd8fb38ff75f5
msgid ""
"It is important to select the proper frame type. This not only loads the "
"correct parameter set, but also selects the correct physics model. In real "
"life, for example, you can configure and setup the ArduPlane firmware for "
"any QuadPlane, but you cannot do that in SITL without having selected the "
"exact QuadPlane frame type for the simulation to get the correct physics "
"model. If a frame type is not selected, a default set for the vehicle type "
"will be loaded, as indicated above."
msgstr ""
"选择正确的机架类型非常重要。这不仅会加载正确的参数集，还会选择正确的物理模型。例如，在实际情况中，您可以为任何 QuadPlane 配置和设置 "
"ArduPlane 固件，但在 SITL 中，必须选择精确的 QuadPlane "
"机架类型才能使仿真使用正确的物理模型。如果未选择机架类型，将加载如上所述的飞行器类型默认设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:110
#: 9d66c1b3a6d9437c8db2624a8eb30b73
msgid "Setting vehicle start location"
msgstr "设置飞行器起始位置"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:112
#: db31d9e7411749fcbc065bc32e767b9a
msgid ""
"You can start the simulator with the vehicle at a particular location by "
"calling **sim_vehicle.py** with the ``-L`` parameter and a named location in"
" the `ardupilot/Tools/autotest/locations.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/locations.txt>`__"
" file."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过使用 ``-L`` 参数和 `ardupilot/Tools/autotest/locations.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/locations.txt>`__"
" 文件中的命名地点来启动仿真器，并将飞行器设置在特定位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:118
#: ef1602e2276b46e394366f210da9293b
msgid ""
"For example, to start Copter in *Ballarat* (a named location in "
"**locations.txt**) call:"
msgstr "例如，要在 *Ballarat*（**locations.txt** 中的命名位置）启动 Copter，请调用："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:128
#: 0231f7e92b834f229e9f3504cd1d8371
msgid ""
"You can add your own locations to the file. The order is Lat,Lng,Alt,Heading"
" where alt is MSL and in meters, and heading is degrees. If the flying "
"location is well-used then consider adding it to the project via a pull "
"request."
msgstr ""
"您可以向文件添加自己的位置。格式为纬度、经度、高度、航向，其中高度为 MSL 海拔（米），航向为度数。如果该飞行地点使用频繁，请考虑通过 PR "
"将其添加到项目中。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:133
#: c726c49026d74f2b834aeaaca2d6bfc7
msgid ""
"You can add your own private locations to a local locations.txt file, in the"
" same format as the main file.  On linux the file is located in "
"``$HOME/.config/ardupilot/locations.txt`` - you will need to create this "
"file using your favourite text editor."
msgstr ""
"您可以将自己的私人位置添加到本地 locations.txt 文件中，格式与主文件相同。在 Linux 上，该文件位于 "
"``$HOME/.config/ardupilot/locations.txt`` ——您需要使用您喜欢的文本编辑器创建此文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:141
#: 581e56df69774b4398a27de9fe23831a
msgid "Loading a different default parameter set"
msgstr "加载不同的默认参数集"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:143
#: e852ff80f81a424099ad7980f2630871
msgid ""
"A set of default parameters are automatically selected by the frame type. "
"However, you may select a different parameter file by using the ``--add-"
"param-file=`` option, instead of manually loading them via the GCS after the"
" simulation starts:"
msgstr ""
"默认参数集由机架类型自动选择。但是，您可以使用 ``--add-param-file=`` "
"选项选择不同的参数文件，而无需在仿真启动后通过地面站手动加载："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:149
#: 1583234a02174e9299cd0f4f71487af2
msgid ""
"the default working directory will be the directory in which sim_vehicle.py "
"was started."
msgstr "默认工作目录将是 sim_vehicle.py 启动时所在的目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:151
#: d7c394f0db57498e8432ac57ed5ec36b
msgid ""
"the \"default\" parameter set emulates the parameter default values "
"contained in the firmware. These are used at startup for parameters, UNLESS "
"the user has previously changed them for a parameter(s), in which case those"
" changed values are used. In SITL, these changes are stored in a file in the"
" simulation startup directory named ``eeprom.bin``. If you wish to startup "
"with only the default values, either that file can be erased, or the ``-w`` "
"options can be used."
msgstr ""
"「默认」参数集模拟固件中包含的参数默认值。这些值在启动时用于参数，除非用户之前已更改过某些参数，在这种情况下将使用那些已更改的值。在 SITL "
"中，这些更改存储在仿真启动目录中名为 ``eeprom.bin`` 的文件中。如果希望仅使用默认值启动，可以删除该文件，或使用 ``-w`` 选项。"

