#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:210
#: 81861d58e89e4208854b0173427ba5e5
msgid "Swarming with SITL"
msgstr "使用 SITL 进行集群仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:212
#: da1b51ac38524792821d42abdee75488
msgid ""
"SITL has support for launching multiple vehicles from a single command. With"
" this method, SITL is restricted to launching vehicles of the same type."
msgstr "SITL 支持从单个命令启动多个飞行器。使用此方法时，SITL 只能启动相同类型的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:215
#: ffcdaafd9d264e84bcf96ea2a096fc85
msgid ""
"When launching multiple vehicles, each one will need a unique SysId "
"parameter: :ref:`MAV_SYSID<MAV_SYSID>`. The easiest method to avoid SysId "
"conflicts is with the ``--auto-sysid`` option."
msgstr ""
"启动多个飞行器时，每个飞行器都需要唯一的 SysId 参数：:ref:`MAV_SYSID<MAV_SYSID>`。避免 SysId "
"冲突最简便的方法是使用 ``--auto-sysid`` 选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:218
#: e5d2fba027fa4b999f8c6ee42bbb5ef0
msgid "The number of vehicles is set with ``--count`` option."
msgstr "飞行器数量通过 ``--count`` 选项设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:220
#: d894c8d449de4f71bea7acb535cef2ff
msgid ""
"Up to this point, all the vehicles would spawn in the same default location "
"and intersect."
msgstr "到目前为止，所有飞行器都会在同一默认位置生成并相互重叠。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:222
#: 89dc335d33b0481b8b9592e93a229b3e
msgid ""
"To avoid that, they must be spawned in unique locations. There are two "
"primary approaches, using either a swarm offset line or a swarm "
"configuration file. Both require a location to be set with ``--location``."
msgstr ""
"为避免这种情况，必须在不同位置生成飞行器。有两种主要方法：使用集群偏移线或集群配置文件。两者都需要使用 ``--location`` 设置位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:226
#: 1ebc98430cb140638c322f375290a7ed
msgid ""
"When using a swarm offset line, the option ``--auto-offset-line 90,10`` will"
" space the vehicles out at a line with heading of 90 degrees orientation. "
"The vehicles will be spaced 10 meters apart. Thus, they will be spread out "
"east-west."
msgstr ""
"使用集群偏移线时，选项 ``--auto-offset-line 90,10`` 将以 90 度航向的线排列飞行器，飞行器间距为 10 "
"米，即沿东西方向分布。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:230
#: 2c7f09dc9ea14c44a336221f8b09dc90
msgid "To send all mavlink data between the vehicles add ``--mcast``."
msgstr "要在飞行器之间发送所有 MAVLink 数据，请添加 ``--mcast``。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:232
#: 29c1a16e77024b78852861a9354ef2e4
msgid ""
"Putting it all together for five Copter vehicles on an auto-offset-line at "
"CMAC:"
msgstr "在 CMAC 以自动偏移线启动 5 架 Copter 飞行器的完整示例："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:239
#: cb6fc4c6272d457fbd8d05798e4cb669
msgid ""
"The other way to spawn the vehicles is the swarm configuration file. An "
"example configuration is found in ``Tools/autotest/swarminit.txt``, with the"
" file format described in the header. This allows configurable ENU offsets "
"as well as an initial absolute heading for each vehicle."
msgstr ""
"另一种生成飞行器的方法是集群配置文件。示例配置文件位于 "
"``Tools/autotest/swarminit.txt``，文件头部描述了文件格式。这允许为每个飞行器配置 ENU 偏移量以及初始绝对航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:247
#: f3522cff16dc4f5fa68475b5e03230db
msgid ""
":ref:`MavProxy's Multiple Vehicle Guide <mavproxy:multi>` contains "
"information to control the swarm."
msgstr ":ref:`MAVProxy 多飞行器指南 <mavproxy:multi>` 包含控制集群的相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:250
#: acd0fa82045b4e49902dfe6a6e0ea64a
msgid "Replaying serial data from Saleae Logic data captures"
msgstr "重放来自 Saleae Logic 数据捕获的串行数据"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:252
#: 65634c06c91342d48195d237e8cc7776
msgid ""
"Saleae Logic is often used when decoding and debugging protocols for the "
"first time.  The \"async serial\" analyzers can export the data to a CSV, "
"and this data can then be replayed through ArduPilot's simulated UARTDriver "
"to test parsing of that data."
msgstr ""
"Saleae Logic 常用于首次解码和调试协议时。「异步串行」分析器可以将数据导出为 CSV，然后可以通过 ArduPilot 的模拟 "
"UARTDriver 重放这些数据，以测试数据解析。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:254
#: 4f9205a1be8341aba38184140caed111
msgid ""
"Serial data is replayed into the simulation at the same rate it appeared on "
"the wire when taking the trace, preserving frame-gaps and the like."
msgstr "串行数据以与在总线上捕获时相同的速率注入仿真，保留帧间隔等特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:256
#: a393d08fb5d24736a07b42577bce5887
msgid ""
"After you have Logic decoding the serial stream, export the data using this "
"interface element:"
msgstr "在 Logic 解码串行流后，使用以下界面元素导出数据："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:262
#: e2643bb5d23242fe90bb933d4f35c5cc
msgid "That data should be in this format:"
msgstr "该数据应为以下格式："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:277
#: 69638bde0ea94fb59eaab12e732039f1
msgid ""
"Place this capture file into the root directory of your ArduPilot repository"
" checkout."
msgstr "将此捕获文件放入 ArduPilot 仓库检出的根目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:279
#: e88888b2ec52424583740b718b181b94
msgid ""
"Specify the schema and filename on the ``sim_vehicle.py`` command-line.  The"
" following example inserts a breakpoint where the data is being read into "
"the parser:"
msgstr "在 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 命令行上指定模式和文件名。以下示例在数据被读入解析器的位置插入一个断点："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:287
#: d9222d15842a4e81837f06f212906869
msgid ""
"Your ``SERIAL5_PROTOCOL`` must be set appropriately for this data to be "
"read."
msgstr "您的 ``SERIAL5_PROTOCOL`` 必须设置适当，才能读取此数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:291
#: 7f6ac2de396e41ebb8bc7ae907f1df03
msgid ""
"There is a 5s simulated-time delay before data is fed into the simulation "
"from the file."
msgstr "从文件向仿真注入数据前，有 5 秒的仿真时间延迟。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:294
#: e34c427493de4f238130989743f3ff8d
msgid "Using a different GCS instead of MAVProxy"
msgstr "使用不同地面站代替 MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:296
#: 03aaa5f9d8544c028d0383937790c33f
msgid ""
"Start ``sim_vehicle`` without starting MAVProxy using the ``--no-mavproxy`` "
"option. SITL will be listening for any GGS station to connect via TCP port "
"5760."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--no-mavproxy`` 选项启动 ``sim_vehicle``，不启动 MAVProxy。SITL 将通过 TCP 端口 5760 "
"等待任何地面站连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:299
#: 806c9194cd41410ab98d61fead2c7c7e
msgid ""
"Many GCS can only initiate the connection via TCP. For Mission Planner or "
"QGC, select TCP, the host ip that sim_vehicle is running on or 127.0.0.1 if "
"running locally, and connect."
msgstr ""
"许多地面站只能通过 TCP 发起连接。对于 Mission Planner 或 QGC，选择 TCP，输入运行 sim_vehicle 的主机 "
"IP（如在本地运行则为 127.0.0.1），然后连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:304
#: d692a10fcaff4d06b1bd8e5ad0d8d4e6
msgid "Mission Planner: Connecting toSITL using TCP"
msgstr "Mission Planner：使用 TCP 连接到 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:307
#: 36f5a09c8ab9476d93096237dc1e23c7
msgid "Using a different GCS instead of MAVProxy (via UDP)"
msgstr "使用不同地面站代替 MAVProxy（通过 UDP）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:309
#: 364c5f34ceb14bac96f5f2cf4fd94aa2
msgid ""
"To connect another GCS using the ``--no-mavproxy`` option and UDP requires "
"adding a startup option to have the simulation output heartbeats on UDP so "
"the GCS can connect:"
msgstr ""
"要使用 ``--no-mavproxy`` 选项通过 UDP 连接其他地面站，需要添加启动选项以使仿真在 UDP 上输出心跳包，以便地面站连接："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:315
#: 871dade11252405c91634ce2d58e4ba8
msgid ""
"where <gcs ip> would be 127.0.0.1 if the GCS is on the same PC or the ip "
"address of a remote PC running a GCS"
msgstr "其中 <gcs ip> 若地面站在同一台 PC 上则为 127.0.0.1，否则为运行地面站的远程 PC 的 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:317
#: c6d389c28dc74ff39976044411f146e2
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, connect to the SITL UDP port by selecting **UDP** and "
"then the **Connect** button. Enter the port to listen on (the default port "
"number of 14550 should be correct if SITL is running on the same computer)."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，选择 **UDP** 然后点击 **Connect** 按钮连接到 SITL UDP "
"端口。输入要监听的端口（如果 SITL 在同一台计算机上运行，默认端口号 14550 应该正确）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:325
#: d6db9cbc3c6a4856b087ea815323a20f
msgid "Mission Planner: Connecting to a UDPPort"
msgstr "Mission Planner：连接到 UDP 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:328
#: fc5ff0164a0e49c0a00cf32089c5fc01
msgid "Using Mission Planner's Simulation feature"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 的仿真功能"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:330
#: d081a3f5a8774c00b489c450b3bce1ee
msgid ""
"Instead of using ``sim_vehicle.py`` under Linux or WSL, you can also "
"simulate using Mission Planner's simulation feature."
msgstr ""
"除了在 Linux 或 WSL 下使用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 外，您还可以使用 Mission Planner 的仿真功能进行仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:332
#: 27a7057ee2f64378b2e62bf66fe4a83d
msgid "See :ref:`mission-planner-simulation`"
msgstr "参见 :ref:`mission-planner-simulation`"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:337
#: 5e308b5b2b2d44a6a3f42546c2efd829
msgid "Connecting other/additional ground stations"
msgstr "连接其他/附加地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:339
#: 5f311ae4c46d4960bee4375dd747a7a8
msgid ""
"SITL can connect to multiple ground stations by using MAVProxy or Mission "
"Planner to forward UDP packets to the GCSs network address."
msgstr "SITL 可以通过使用 MAVProxy 或 Mission Planner 将 UDP 数据包转发到地面站网络地址来连接多个地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:345
#: e7052d476c7942a4958bbb6eecac846e
msgid "Using MAVProxy (UDP) forwarding"
msgstr "使用 MAVProxy（UDP）转发"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:347
#: 7af3022b941c4f4fbdc69800f38bd307
msgid ""
"Multiple ground stations can be connected to SITL by using MAVProxy to "
"forward UDP packets to the GCSs network address (for example, forwarding to "
"another Windows box or Android tablet on your local network). The simulated "
"vehicle can then be controlled and viewed through any attached GCS."
msgstr ""
"多个地面站可以通过 MAVProxy 将 UDP 数据包转发到地面站网络地址（例如，转发到本地网络上的另一台 Windows 机器或 Android "
"平板）连接到 SITL。仿真飞行器可以通过任何连接的地面站进行控制和查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:353
#: 351295be7af14a27a0fd040119009f6f
msgid ""
"First find the IP address of the machine running the GCS. How you get the "
"address is platform dependent (on Windows you can use the 'ipconfig' command"
" to find the computer's address)."
msgstr "首先找到运行地面站的机器的 IP 地址。获取地址的方法取决于平台（在 Windows 上可以使用「ipconfig」命令查找计算机地址）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:357
#: a584dcc910a742b3af9e1941a453e7ca
msgid ""
"Assuming the IP address of the GCS is 192.168.14.82, you would add this "
"address/port as a MAVProxy output using:"
msgstr "假设地面站的 IP 地址为 192.168.14.82，您可以使用以下方法将该地址/端口添加为 MAVProxy 输出："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:364
#: 685fd94816904da2bda7f8c925f81598
msgid "The GCS would then connect to SITL by listening on that UDP port."
msgstr "地面站随后通过监听该 UDP 端口连接到 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:368
#: 5ea43f782aac486aaf7c2197a26b56c3
msgid ""
"If you're running the GCS on the **same machine** as SITL then an "
"appropriate output may already exist. Check this by calling ``output`` on "
"the *MAVProxy command prompt*:"
msgstr ""
"如果您在与 SITL **相同的机器** 上运行地面站，则可能已经存在适当的输出。可以通过在 *MAVProxy 命令提示符*下调用 "
"``output`` 来检查："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:379
#: ed1be574422643fb8d79b91c9327905b
msgid ""
"In this case we can connect a GCS running on the same machine to UDP port "
"14550 or 14551. We can choose to connect another GCS to the remaining port, "
"and add more ports if needed."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，我们可以将运行在同一机器上的地面站连接到 UDP 端口 14550 或 "
"14551。我们可以选择将另一个地面站连接到剩余端口，并根据需要添加更多端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:384
#: 053294c08c5c404fb2c58d408c21e49c
msgid "Using Mission Planner Forwarding"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 转发"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:386
#: 5e110e45e9624dbf9ad24c65230ff6cd
msgid ""
"Mission Planner can forward to other GCS using it Mavlink Mirror. Under "
"SETUP/Advanced/Mavlink Mirror set the connection type (usually UDP Client), "
"baud rate (11520 for UDP),optional write access to allow the connecting GCS "
"to changes things, and press connect. A listening GCS will automtically "
"connect to SITL."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 可以通过其 Mavlink Mirror 转发到其他地面站。在 SETUP/Advanced/Mavlink "
"Mirror 下设置连接类型（通常为 UDP Client）、波特率（UDP 为 "
"11520）、可选写入权限以允许连接的地面站更改设置，然后点击连接。监听的地面站将自动连接到 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:392
#: b46f509f8be340b7951872dead9a1f58
msgid "SITL Simulation Parameters"
msgstr "SITL 仿真参数"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:400
#: 5649d7f57615456491933e9f09885d5d
msgid "Adding simulated devices to sim_vehicle"
msgstr "向 sim_vehicle 添加模拟设备"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:408
#: 7a6dd656e61e4055ae6668f4547871dc
msgid "Accessing log files"
msgstr "访问日志文件"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:410
#: 025af1d3071249cd83ae3022cdda8a8f
msgid ""
"SITL supports both Block Logging and SD card storage DataFlash logs (the "
"same as used with physical autopilots). The SD card logs are stored in a "
"\"logs\" subdirectory in the directory where you start sim_vehicle or in "
"Mission Planner's sitl/logs directory in the its documents folder. The Block"
" Flash logs are stored in the blackbox.bin file. You can also access the "
"logs via MAVLink using a GCS, but directly accessing SD card emulated logs "
"in the logs/ directory is usually more convenient."
msgstr ""
"SITL 同时支持块日志和 SD 卡存储的 DataFlash 日志（与物理飞控使用的相同）。SD 卡日志存储在启动 sim_vehicle "
"的目录下的「logs」子目录中，或 Mission Planner 文档文件夹的 sitl/logs 目录中。块闪存日志存储在 blackbox.bin"
" 文件中。您也可以通过地面站使用 MAVLink 访问日志，但直接访问 logs/ 目录中的 SD 卡模拟日志通常更为方便。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:414
#: 105fe104a54e4e8d8b6e7bb2677a4c64
msgid ""
"To keep your logs organized it is recommended you start SITL using the \"--"
"aircraft NAME\" option. That will create a subdirectory called NAME which "
"will have flight logs organized by date. Each simulation run will get its "
"own directory, and will include the parameters for the flight plus any "
"downloaded waypoints and rally points."
msgstr ""
"为保持日志有序，建议使用「--aircraft NAME」选项启动 SITL。这将创建一个名为 NAME "
"的子目录，其中包含按日期整理的飞行日志。每次仿真运行都会获得自己的目录，并包含飞行参数以及任何下载的航点和集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:421
#: 432520170f65401a8976cfdb14e5459f
msgid "Graphing vehicle state"
msgstr "绘制飞行器状态图"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:423
#: d93c861b772843b0b88f179cc1af8bc0
msgid ""
"MAVProxy allows you to create graphs of inputs, outputs, internal variables,"
" etc. by loading the ``graph`` module."
msgstr "MAVProxy 允许您通过加载 ``graph`` 模块来创建输入、输出、内部变量等的图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:431
#: f794a6811cc84f8cb725caeca1cb371c
msgid ""
"You can then create graphs of vehicle state using the graph command. For "
"example, to graph the RC channel 3 input during the simulation:"
msgstr "然后可以使用 graph 命令创建飞行器状态图。例如，要在仿真期间绘制 RC 通道 3 的输入："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:437
#: cb6028982f094716b2d4a44f7337eca6
msgid ""
"As with most commands, you can type ``graph`` and then double tab to see "
"available completions. In the example above the `RC_CHANNELS` group contains"
" the 16 rc channels, so typing ``graph RC_CHANNELS``, then double tab would "
"show those."
msgstr ""
"与大多数命令一样，您可以输入 ``graph`` 然后双击 TAB 键查看可用补全项。在上面的例子中，`RC_CHANNELS` 组包含 16 个 RC"
" 通道，因此输入 ``graph RC_CHANNELS`` 然后双击 TAB 键将显示这些通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:439
#: 69816307eea8455b8308af890df5f0a9
msgid ""
"Since these are rather long to type, MAVProxy allows for the creation of "
"shorter aliases.  There have been many aliases created in a file present in "
"the ArduPilot source tree in the Tools/vagrant sub-directory called "
"**mavinit.scr**. If this file is copied and placed in your home directory "
"and renamed to **.mavinit.scr**, it will be used upon *MAVProxy's* "
"initialization.  Common ones are: *g* for graph, *grc* to graph the RC "
"inputs, *gservo8* to graph the first 8 output channels instead of typing "
"long item names eight times, etc. Using this alias initialization file also "
"has the advantage of automatically loading the graph module upon startup, so"
" you will not have to load it."
msgstr ""
"由于这些命令输入较长，MAVProxy 允许创建更短的别名。在 ArduPilot 源代码树的 Tools/vagrant 子目录中有一个名为 "
"**mavinit.scr** 的文件，其中已创建了许多别名。如果将该文件复制到主目录并重命名为 **.mavinit.scr**，则会在 "
"*MAVProxy* 初始化时使用它。常用别名有：*g* 表示 graph，*grc* 表示绘制 RC 输入图，*gservo8* 表示绘制前 8 "
"个输出通道图（无需输入 8 次长项目名称）等。使用此别名初始化文件还有一个优点：在启动时自动加载 graph 模块，因此您不必手动加载它。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:441
#: e9c42caebf7c417691d3407e9a7022d4
msgid ""
"Mission Planner allows graphing using the \"tuning\" box in the DATA tab's "
"map screen. Checking that box will open a graph screen. Double clicking it "
"will present a selection dialog of what messages/data to graph."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 允许使用 DATA "
"选项卡地图界面中的「tuning」复选框进行绘图。勾选该复选框将打开图表界面。双击将弹出选择对话框，用于选择要绘制的消息/数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:444
#: 3e4714b8c5284640851d5782214dbfa2
msgid "Using a joystick"
msgstr "使用摇杆"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:446
#: 8f90e37344d240ce99f0b3b1ddbfdd3c
msgid ""
"It can be useful to use a joystick for input in SITL. The joystick can be a "
"real RC transmitter with a USB dongle for the trainer port, or something "
"like the RealFlight interlink controller or a wide range of other joystick "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"在 SITL 中使用摇杆输入很有用。摇杆可以是带有 USB 教练端口适配器的真实遥控器，或者像 RealFlight Interlink "
"控制器这样的设备，或各种其他摇杆设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:451
#: 869da319088a48309447f18a43ad224e
msgid ""
"Before you use the joystick support you may need to remove debug statements "
"from the python-pygame joystick driver on Linux. If you don't then you may "
"see lots of debug output like this:"
msgstr ""
"在使用摇杆支持之前，您可能需要删除 Linux 上 python-pygame 摇杆驱动程序中的调试语句。否则您可能会看到大量如下的调试输出："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:459
#: a0d2ffacf45e43a8afb36a066c7657b5
msgid "To remove this debug line run this command:"
msgstr "要删除此调试行，运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:465
#: 6f22a2cc36104177a594dcc327f23484
msgid ""
"note that this needs to be one long command line. Ignore the line wrapping "
"in the wiki. If you have installed the joystick support using the "
"instructions on setting up the ArduPilot code building environment, then "
"this will probably NOT be required."
msgstr ""
